WEBVTT

00:04:58.214 --> 00:05:00.413
especially those who emit the most.

00:05:01.225 --> 00:05:04.856
To those yet to join,
my message is simple:

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:08.186
We can only win the race to zero together.

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:10.957
So I urge you all to get on board.

00:05:10.981 --> 00:05:12.963
The countdown has begun.